<span id="A3.T12.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Open-world results. <span id="A3.T12.11.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Concept Similarity</span></span> (<span id="A3.T12.11.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">bCS</span>) on the ten datasets.
<span id="A3.T12.11.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#E1D5E7;"> <span id="A3.T12.11.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_phantom"><span style="visibility:hidden">Ay</span></span>Purple </span> indicates our CIRCLE.
