<span id="A3.T18.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Open-world results. <span id="A3.T18.11.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Llama Inclusion</span></span> (<span id="A3.T18.11.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">LI</span>) on the ten datasets.
<span id="A3.T18.11.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#E1D5E7;"> <span id="A3.T18.11.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_phantom"><span style="visibility:hidden">Ay</span></span>Purple </span> indicates our CIRCLE.
Higher is better.
For each LMM, <span id="A3.T18.11.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span> indicates the best result.
<math id="A3.T18.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta</annotation></semantics></math> computed w.r.t.<span id="A3.T18.11.5" class="ltx_text"></span> the average (Avg.) of <span id="A3.T18.11.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Zero-Shot</span>.
For each LMM, <span id="A3.T18.11.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span> indicates the best result.
Results are split in <a href="#A3.T18.st1" title="In Table 18 ‣ Appendix C Open-world results ‣ Large Multimodal Models as General In-Context Classifiers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Tabs.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">18(a)</span></a>, <a href="#A3.T19.st1" title="Table 19(a) ‣ Appendix C Open-world results ‣ Large Multimodal Models as General In-Context Classifiers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">19(a)</span></a> and <a href="#A3.T20.st1" title="Table 20(a) ‣ Appendix C Open-world results ‣ Large Multimodal Models as General In-Context Classifiers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">20(a)</span></a> for readability.
</span></figcaption>
