<span id="A4.T23.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Streaming results. <span id="A4.T23.11.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Concept Similarity</span></span> (<span id="A4.T23.11.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">bCS</span>) on the ten datasets.
