<span id="A4.T25.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Streaming open-world results. <span id="A4.T25.11.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Llama Inclusion</span></span> (<span id="A4.T25.11.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">LI</span>) on the ten datasets.
<span id="A4.T25.11.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#E1D5E7;"> <span id="A4.T25.11.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_phantom"><span style="visibility:hidden">Ay</span></span>Purple </span> indicates our CIRCLE.
Higher is better.
For each LMM, <span id="A4.T25.11.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span> indicates the best result.
<math id="A4.T25.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta</annotation></semantics></math> computed w.r.t.<span id="A4.T25.11.5" class="ltx_text"></span> the average (Avg.) of <span id="A4.T25.11.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Zero-Shot</span>.
For each LMM, <span id="A4.T25.11.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span> indicates the best result.
</span></figcaption>
