<span id="A6.F11.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Qualitative results from Oxford Pets <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib39" title="" class="ltx_ref">28</a>]</cite>.</span>
